 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "mi_01",
   "t": 0.55,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.97,
   "ref": "Mark 2:1-2",
   "zh": "耶稣来到迦百农，住在彼得家。大家听说了，一下子全挤来了，屋里屋外都是人！",
   "en": "Jesus came to the town of Capernaum and stayed at Peter's house. Everyone heard, and they all squeezed in. People inside, people outside, people everywhere!",
   "dir": "storyteller opening, bright; speed up and pile on 屋里屋外都是人 / 'people everywhere'",
   "dur": 9.9154,
   "pre": 0.25,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "",
    "edge": "origin",
    "dt": 0.55
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_02",
   "t": 10.97,
   "who": "jesus",
   "voice": "jesus",
   "maxSec": 5.35,
   "ref": "Mark 2:2; Luke 17:21",
   "zh": "上帝爱你们每一个人。他的国，就在你们中间。",
   "en": "God loves every one of you. His kingdom is right here among you.",
   "dir": "warm and simple, smiling at the people; not preachy",
   "dur": 5.3,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_01",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.5
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_03",
   "t": 16.87,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 10.35,
   "ref": "Mark 2:3",
   "zh": "这时候，路上来了四个好朋友，抬着一个人。这个人的腿不能走路，只能天天躺在褥子上。",
   "en": "Just then, four good friends came down the road, carrying a man. His legs couldn't walk, so every day he had to lie on his mat.",
   "dir": "warm, a little tender on 只能天天躺在褥子上 / 'every day he had to lie'",
   "dur": 10.3,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.1,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_02",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_04",
   "t": 27.47,
   "who": "friend1",
   "voice": "friend1",
   "maxSec": 5.35,
   "ref": "Mark 2:3-5",
   "zh": "加油！耶稣一定能帮你！",
   "en": "Come on, we're nearly there! Jesus can help you, I know He can!",
   "dir": "bright, panting a little from carrying; total certainty in 一定 / 'I know He can'",
   "dur": 5.3,
   "pre": 0.2,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_03",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_05",
   "t": 33.17,
   "who": "man",
   "voice": "man",
   "maxSec": 2.89,
   "ref": "Mark 2:3",
   "zh": "谢谢你们……我好紧张呀。",
   "en": "Thank you, friends... I'm so nervous.",
   "dir": "small, shy, a nervous little laugh",
   "dur": 2.8429,
   "pre": 0.2,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_04",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_06",
   "t": 36.71,
   "who": "friend3",
   "voice": "friend3",
   "maxSec": 3.09,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4",
   "zh": "请让一让！让一让——哎哟！",
   "en": "Excuse me! Excuse me, please... oof!",
   "dir": "polite and hopeful, then a comic 'oof' as he bounces off the crowd",
   "dur": 3.0429,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_05",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_07",
   "t": 40.05,
   "who": "people",
   "voice": "people",
   "maxSec": 2.32,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4",
   "zh": "别挤啦！进不去啦！",
   "en": "No pushing! There's no room!",
   "dir": "crowd of 8-10, grumbly but not nasty, overlapping",
   "dur": 2.2667,
   "pre": 0.1,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_06",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_08",
   "t": 43.22,
   "who": "friend2",
   "voice": "friend2",
   "maxSec": 3.04,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4",
   "zh": "嗯……门进不去……",
   "en": "Hmm... we can't get in the door...",
   "dir": "big slow friend, thinking out loud, long 嗯 / 'hmm'",
   "dur": 2.9923,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_07",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.9
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_09",
   "t": 46.61,
   "who": "friend1",
   "voice": "friend1",
   "maxSec": 3.81,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4",
   "zh": "有了！我们从屋顶下去！",
   "en": "I've got it! We'll go in through the roof!",
   "dir": "sudden bright idea, finger up; a little gasp before 有了 / 'I've got it'",
   "dur": 3.7615,
   "pre": 0.1,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_08",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_10",
   "t": 51.07,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.2,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4",
   "zh": "他们抬着朋友，一步一步爬上了屋顶。那时候的屋顶是平的，用木头、树枝和泥土铺成。",
   "en": "Step by step, they carried their friend up onto the roof. In those days roofs were flat, made of wood, branches and mud.",
   "dir": "steady, a bit breathless with them on 一步一步 / 'step by step'; then explaining, friendly",
   "dur": 9.1462,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_09",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_11",
   "t": 61.52,
   "who": "friends",
   "voice": "friends",
   "maxSec": 2.66,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4",
   "zh": "挖呀挖，挖呀挖！",
   "en": "Dig, dig, dig! Dig, dig, dig!",
   "dir": "the four friends together, a cheerful work chant, rhythmic",
   "dur": 2.6077,
   "pre": 1.0,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_10",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_12",
   "t": 65.93,
   "who": "peter",
   "voice": "peter",
   "maxSec": 2.7,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4",
   "zh": "哎！哎哎哎！我的屋顶！",
   "en": "Hey! Hey, hey, HEY! My roof!",
   "dir": "big comic panic; rising 哎 three times; 我的屋顶 / 'My roof!' almost a wail, funny",
   "dur": 2.6548,
   "pre": 1.4,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_11",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_13",
   "t": 69.18,
   "who": "jesus",
   "voice": "jesus",
   "maxSec": 3.48,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4-5",
   "zh": "哈哈，彼得，你看——有人来了。",
   "en": "Ha ha! Peter, look... someone's coming.",
   "dir": "amused, warm chuckle; gentle teasing to Peter; curious on 有人来了 / 'someone's coming'",
   "dur": 3.431,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_12",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_14",
   "t": 73.51,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.05,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4",
   "zh": "他们在屋顶上挖了一个洞，用绳子把褥子慢慢地、慢慢地放下来，正好放在耶稣面前。",
   "en": "They made a hole in the roof, and with ropes they let the mat down... slowly... slowly... right in front of Jesus.",
   "dir": "hushed and suspenseful; stretch 慢慢地、慢慢地 / 'slowly... slowly'; land softly on 耶稣面前",
   "dur": 8.9952,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_13",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.9
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_15",
   "t": 83.51,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 6.12,
   "ref": "Mark 2:5",
   "zh": "耶稣抬头看见四个朋友，知道他们真的相信他。",
   "en": "Jesus looked up at the four friends, and He saw how much they trusted Him.",
   "dir": "warm and slow; a small smile in the voice on 真的相信 / 'trusted Him'",
   "dur": 6.0692,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_14",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_16",
   "t": 90.18,
   "who": "jesus",
   "voice": "jesus",
   "maxSec": 2.55,
   "ref": "Mark 2:5",
   "zh": "孩子，你的罪赦免了。",
   "en": "Son, your sins are forgiven.",
   "dir": "very tender, close, like a father; unhurried",
   "dur": 2.5048,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.6,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_15",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_17",
   "t": 93.58,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 6.84,
   "ref": "Mark 2:6-8",
   "zh": "有人在心里嘀咕：只有上帝才能赦罪啊！耶稣知道他们在想什么。",
   "en": "Some people grumbled inside: only God can forgive sins! Jesus knew what they were thinking.",
   "dir": "a touch of mystery on the grumble (lower voice), then plain",
   "dur": 6.7905,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_16",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.9
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_18",
   "t": 100.97,
   "who": "jesus",
   "voice": "jesus",
   "maxSec": 4.97,
   "ref": "Mark 2:9-10",
   "zh": "为了让你们知道，我有赦罪的权柄——",
   "en": "So that you will know I have the power to forgive sins...",
   "dir": "calm, clear, to the whole room; a pause at the dash",
   "dur": 4.9154,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_17",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_19",
   "t": 106.39,
   "who": "jesus",
   "voice": "jesus",
   "maxSec": 3.81,
   "ref": "Mark 2:11",
   "zh": "起来！拿起你的褥子，回家去吧！",
   "en": "Get up! Pick up your mat, and go home!",
   "dir": "joyful command, bright and strong, a smile in it; not shouted",
   "dur": 3.7615,
   "pre": 0.1,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_18",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.5
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_20",
   "t": 112.15,
   "who": "man",
   "voice": "man",
   "maxSec": 4.25,
   "ref": "Mark 2:12",
   "zh": "我……我的腿……我站起来了！我能走了！",
   "en": "My... my legs... I'm standing! I can walk!",
   "dir": "disbelief to laughter: stammer, a gasp, then pure joy on 我能走了 / 'I can walk!'",
   "dur": 4.1952,
   "pre": 1.6,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_19",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_21",
   "t": 117.14,
   "who": "people",
   "voice": "people",
   "maxSec": 3.51,
   "ref": "Mark 2:12",
   "zh": "哇！我们从来没见过这样的事！",
   "en": "Wow! We have never seen anything like this!",
   "dir": "crowd of 8-10, amazed, overlapping gasps and a child's 哇",
   "dur": 3.4571,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_20",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_22",
   "t": 121.0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 3.51,
   "ref": "Mark 2:12",
   "zh": "大家都很惊奇，一起赞美上帝。",
   "en": "Everyone was amazed, and they all praised God.",
   "dir": "warm and glowing",
   "dur": 3.4571,
   "pre": 0.2,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_21",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_23",
   "t": 124.86,
   "who": "peter",
   "voice": "peter",
   "maxSec": 3.81,
   "ref": "Mark 2:4, 12",
   "zh": "好吧好吧——这个洞，挖得值！",
   "en": "All right, all right... that hole was worth it!",
   "dir": "big hearty laugh first, then shaking his head, delighted",
   "dur": 3.7615,
   "pre": 0.2,
   "post": 0.6,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_22",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_24",
   "t": 129.62,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.2,
   "ref": "Mark 4:35-36",
   "zh": "那天傍晚，耶稣对门徒说：我们到湖对岸去吧。他们就上了彼得的船。",
   "en": "That evening, Jesus said to His friends: let's go across to the other side of the lake. So they got into Peter's boat.",
   "dir": "calm, evening voice, a gentle lilt like the water",
   "dur": 9.1462,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_23",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_25",
   "t": 139.67,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.97,
   "ref": "Mark 4:38",
   "zh": "耶稣忙了一整天，累了，枕着一个枕头，在船尾睡着了。",
   "en": "Jesus had been busy all day. He was tired, so He lay down on a cushion at the back of the boat and fell asleep.",
   "dir": "soft, sleepy, smiling",
   "dur": 9.9154,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_24",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.9
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_26",
   "t": 150.98,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 7.66,
   "ref": "Mark 4:37",
   "zh": "忽然，起了一阵大风暴！浪一个接一个打进船里，船里的水都快满了！",
   "en": "Suddenly a huge storm came! Wave after wave crashed into the boat, and it was filling up with water!",
   "dir": "exciting, faster, a little breathless; big on 大风暴 / 'huge storm'",
   "dur": 7.6077,
   "pre": 1.0,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_25",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_27",
   "t": 159.39,
   "who": "peter",
   "voice": "peter",
   "maxSec": 4.2,
   "ref": "Mark 4:37",
   "zh": "舀水！快舀水！不行啦，水太多啦！",
   "en": "Bail! Bail faster! It's no good, there's too much water!",
   "dir": "comic panic, shouting over the wind, breathless; voice cracks on 不行啦 / 'no good'",
   "dur": 4.1462,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_26",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_28",
   "t": 165.33,
   "who": "peter",
   "voice": "peter",
   "maxSec": 6.1,
   "ref": "Mark 4:38",
   "zh": "老师！老师，快醒醒！我们快要沉下去了，你不管我们吗？",
   "en": "Teacher! Teacher, wake up! We're going to sink! Don't you care about us?",
   "dir": "frantic, shaking Him; the last question hurt and scared, not angry",
   "dur": 6.05,
   "pre": 1.6,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_27",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_29",
   "t": 171.98,
   "who": "jesus",
   "voice": "jesus",
   "maxSec": 2.85,
   "ref": "Mark 4:39",
   "zh": "风，停下来！浪，安静吧！",
   "en": "Wind, stop! Waves... be still!",
   "dir": "firm and strong but not angry; a small pause before 安静吧 / 'be still', then soft",
   "dur": 2.8048,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.6,
   "anchor": {
