   "id": "mi_30",
   "t": 177.19,
   "who": "jesus",
   "voice": "jesus",
   "maxSec": 4.58,
   "ref": "Mark 4:40",
   "zh": "你们为什么害怕呢？还不相信我吗？",
   "en": "Why were you so afraid? Do you still not trust Me?",
   "dir": "very gentle, a small smile, like a friend; not a telling-off",
   "dur": 4.5308,
   "pre": 1.8,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_29",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_31",
   "t": 182.52,
   "who": "peter",
   "voice": "peter",
   "maxSec": 5.35,
   "ref": "Mark 4:41",
   "zh": "他到底是谁？连风和浪都听他的话！",
   "en": "Who is this? Even the wind and the waves do what He says!",
   "dir": "awed whisper to himself, then louder with wonder on 连风和浪 / 'even the wind'",
   "dur": 5.3,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_30",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_32",
   "t": 188.72,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.97,
   "ref": "Mark 2:10-12; Mark 4:41",
   "zh": "变魔术，是骗眼睛的。耶稣行的是真正的神迹：他让我们知道，他爱我们，也有能力帮助我们。",
   "en": "A magic trick fools your eyes. But Jesus did real miracles. They show us that He loves us, and He is able to help us.",
   "dir": "warm moral, straight to the child; slow and clear on the last sentence",
   "dur": 9.9154,
   "pre": 0.5,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_31",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.9
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "mi_33",
   "t": 199.24,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 6.99,
   "ref": "Mark 2:3-5",
   "zh": "就像那四个好朋友，我们也可以把需要帮助的人，带到耶稣面前。",
   "en": "And just like the four good friends, we can bring people who need help to Jesus too.",
   "dir": "encouraging, a smile; lift on 四个好朋友 / 'four good friends'",
   "dur": 6.9405,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "mi_32",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  }
